    { "key": "win.won_title", "text": "CHAPTER {0} COMPLETE!" },
    { "key": "win.learned.1", "text": "You learned: solar panels make power blocks, and life support turns water and power into oxygen. Robots build only when they have power." },
    { "key": "win.learned.2", "text": "You learned: ice in the dark craters gives water, and plants in the greenhouse need power and water. Science comes from Moon rocks." },
    { "key": "win.learned.3", "text": "You learned: solar storms are real. In a storm the crew hides in a shelter with power, and regolith on the roof blocks the rays." },
