    { "key": "help.close", "text": "GOT IT" },
    { "key": "help.l1", "text": "You are the chief engineer of a base at the Moon's south pole. Keep your crew alive: oxygen, water and food must never run out." },
    { "key": "help.l2", "text": "Walk with W A S D or the arrows. SPACE jumps. Q and E turn the camera. The mouse wheel zooms." },
    { "key": "help.l3", "text": "TAB opens your tablet: build modules, share power, give jobs to the crew, order supplies. The game waits while the tablet is open." },
    { "key": "help.l4", "text": "Power is limited. Every block you give to one system is taken from another, so think about what matters most right now." },
    { "key": "help.l5", "text": "Solar storms are real NASA events. When the warning comes, bring everybody into a shelter that has power." },
    { "key": "help.l6", "text": "Every evening a report shows what changed and why. Read the red lines first." },
    { "key": "help.l7", "text": "Keys: P pause · 1 2 3 speed x1 x2 x4 · M sound · H this help · ESC menu." },
